      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. One thing we're really worried about is the 'break' in the chain during handovers at the various customs checkpoints and local warehouses. There's a lot of potential for human error or even theft/tampering during those brief windows when the shipment is being moved between vehicles or sitting on a tarmac. How can we build more robust security and oversight into the checklist to mitigate those specific risks of loss or interference during the handoff phases?",
